  "description": "The La Ruta Rando is handsome touring bike built around a lightweight welded Cromoly steel frame with butted tubes and lost wax dropouts and a Cromoly fork with an invest cast crown. The steel chassis will dampen vibrations, while the Road Plus WTB Horizon tyres 650Bx47C are absolutely amazing for catching miles. Equipped with Shimano 105 2x11 speed. Sturdy aluminium front and rear racks are designed for gravel and touring. Fitted with a new unique Brooks limited edition saddle and bar tape. Supernova dynamo LED lights and full length mudguards complete the package. Finished in a high-end multi layer paint with a matt powder coat in Mud Green. A unique combination of retro styling and modern features make the Rando a very special bike.",
